 "blobs": {
  "sha256:9a3d6e6ea03f3cebb4503e479eab2dda917cc122d610be889d81d3aaf81b4023": "Version 4\r\nSHEET 1 1200 800\r\nWIRE 0 -32 48 -32\r\nWIRE 128 -32 208 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 256 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 208 16\r\nWIRE 208 80 208 128\r\nWIRE 0 16 0 -32\r\nWIRE 0 96 0 128\r\nFLAG 208 128 0\r\nFLAG 256 -32 out\r\nFLAG 0 128 0\r\nFLAG 0 -32 in\r\nSYMBOL voltage 0 0 R0\r\nWINDOW 3 24 96 Invisible 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName V1\r\nSYMATTR Value PULSE(0 1 0 1n 1n 1 2)\r\nSYMBOL res 144 -48 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 0 56 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName R1\r\nSYMATTR Value 1k\r\nSYMBOL cap 192 16 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName C1\r\nSYMATTR Value 100n\r\nTEXT 0 -224 Left 2 ;First-order low-pass (RC): H(s) = 1 / (1 + sRC) = ωc / (s + ωc)\\nτ = RC = 100 µs and fc = 1 / (2π RC) ≈ 1.59 kHz: one pole at s = −1/RC = −10 krad/s and no finite zero.\\nStep: out rises as 1 − e^(−t/τ) (63 % at t = τ). Bode: −3 dB at fc and then −20 dB/decade; the phase goes from 0 to −90°.\r\nTEXT 0 192 Left 2 !.tran 1m\r\n",
  "sha256:bd066352326317f5fff568973814c3613ffeb54078bceee3622fb9ccacf398c8": "Version 4\r\nSHEET 1 1200 800\r\nWIRE 0 -32 48 -32\r\nWIRE 128 -32 208 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 256 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 208 16\r\nWIRE 208 80 208 128\r\nWIRE 0 16 0 -32\r\nWIRE 0 96 0 128\r\nFLAG 208 128 0\r\nFLAG 256 -32 out\r\nFLAG 0 128 0\r\nFLAG 0 -32 in\r\nSYMBOL voltage 0 0 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName V1\r\nSYMATTR Value AC 1\r\nSYMBOL res 144 -48 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 0 56 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName R1\r\nSYMATTR Value 1k\r\nSYMBOL cap 192 16 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName C1\r\nSYMATTR Value 100n\r\nTEXT 0 -224 Left 2 ;First-order low-pass (RC): H(s) = 1 / (1 + sRC) = ωc / (s + ωc)\\nτ = RC = 100 µs and fc = 1 / (2π RC) ≈ 1.59 kHz: one pole at s = −1/RC = −10 krad/s and no finite zero.\\nStep: out rises as 1 − e^(−t/τ) (63 % at t = τ). Bode: −3 dB at fc and then −20 dB/decade; the phase goes from 0 to −90°.\r\nTEXT 0 192 Left 2 !.ac dec 100 10 100k\r\n",
  "sha256:32c9a45b93d157bef1c0ae3571f5bd703d2f7ce84d64b8c62530b0ff607e3f0d": "Version 4\r\nSHEET 1 1200 800\r\nWIRE 0 -32 48 -32\r\nWIRE 128 -32 208 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 256 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 208 16\r\nWIRE 208 80 208 128\r\nWIRE 0 16 0 -32\r\nWIRE 0 96 0 128\r\nFLAG 208 128 0\r\nFLAG 256 -32 out\r\nFLAG 0 128 0\r\nFLAG 0 -32 in\r\nSYMBOL voltage 0 0 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName V1\r\nSYMATTR Value AC 1\r\nSYMBOL res 144 -48 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 0 56 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName R1\r\nSYMATTR Value 1k\r\nSYMBOL cap 192 16 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName C1\r\nSYMATTR Value 100n\r\nTEXT 0 -224 Left 2 ;First-order low-pass (RC): H(s) = 1 / (1 + sRC) = ωc / (s + ωc)\\nτ = RC = 100 µs and fc = 1 / (2π RC) ≈ 1.59 kHz: one pole at s = −1/RC = −10 krad/s and no finite zero.\\nStep: out rises as 1 − e^(−t/τ) (63 % at t = τ). Bode: −3 dB at fc and then −20 dB/decade; the phase goes from 0 to −90°.\r\nTEXT 0 192 Left 2 ;.pz in 0 out 0 vol pz\r\n",
  "sha256:4eb6cb5c0d5e039b63af4cab7eaea73a2a1ea3bc3a5eed2320f43a0cf9ac078b": "Version 4\r\nSHEET 1 1200 800\r\nWIRE 0 -32 48 -32\r\nWIRE 128 -32 208 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 256 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 208 16\r\nWIRE 208 80 208 128\r\nWIRE 0 16 0 -32\r\nWIRE 0 96 0 128\r\nFLAG 208 128 0\r\nFLAG 256 -32 out\r\nFLAG 0 128 0\r\nFLAG 0 -32 in\r\nSYMBOL voltage 0 0 R0\r\nWINDOW 3 24 96 Invisible 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName V1\r\nSYMATTR Value PULSE(0 1 0 1n 1n 1 2)\r\nSYMBOL res 144 -48 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 0 56 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName R1\r\nSYMATTR Value {R}\r\nSYMBOL cap 192 16 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName C1\r\nSYMATTR Value 100n\r\nTEXT 0 -224 Left 2 ;First-order low-pass (RC): H(s) = 1 / (1 + sRC) = ωc / (s + ωc)\\nτ = RC = 100 µs and fc = 1 / (2π RC) ≈ 1.59 kHz: one pole at s = −1/RC = −10 krad/s and no finite zero.\\nStep: out rises as 1 − e^(−t/τ) (63 % at t = τ). Bode: −3 dB at fc and then −20 dB/decade; the phase goes from 0 to −90°.\r\nTEXT 0 256 Left 2 !.step param R list 500 1k 2k\\n.meas tran trise TRIG V(out) VAL=0.1 RISE=1 TARG V(out) VAL=0.9 RISE=1\r\nTEXT 0 352 Left 2 ;With .step, one run per value of R (500, 1k and 2k); the .meas gives the rise time, 2.2 RC.\r\nTEXT 0 408 Left 2 !.tran 1m\r\n",
  "sha256:dece81707e60d490bcee7e8cbe63897880b324f979f0be968d740f2b59bf565b": "Version 4\r\nSHEET 1 1200 800\r\nWIRE 0 -32 48 -32\r\nWIRE 112 -32 208 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 256 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 208 16\r\nWIRE 208 96 208 128\r\nWIRE 0 16 0 -32\r\nWIRE 0 96 0 128\r\nFLAG 208 128 0\r\nFLAG 256 -32 out\r\nFLAG 0 128 0\r\nFLAG 0 -32 in\r\nSYMBOL voltage 0 0 R0\r\nWINDOW 3 24 96 Invisible 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName V1\r\nSYMATTR Value PULSE(0 1 0 1n 1n 1 2)\r\nSYMBOL cap 112 -48 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 0 32 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 32 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName C1\r\nSYMATTR Value 100n\r\nSYMBOL res 192 0 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName R1\r\nSYMATTR Value 1k\r\nTEXT 0 -224 Left 2 ;First-order high-pass (CR): H(s) = sRC / (1 + sRC) = s / (s + ωc)\\nfc = 1 / (2π RC) ≈ 1.59 kHz: one pole at s = −1/RC and a zero at s = 0.\\nStep: out jumps to 1 and decays as e^(−t/τ). Bode: +20 dB/decade below fc and flat above; the phase goes from +90° to 0.\r\nTEXT 0 192 Left 2 !.tran 1m\r\n",
  "sha256:5f4c04e8082c6350355c69a13728142f2ac0532e5cb4db0217dfee6c5374932c": "Version 4\r\nSHEET 1 1200 800\r\nWIRE 0 -32 48 -32\r\nWIRE 112 -32 208 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 256 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 208 16\r\nWIRE 208 96 208 128\r\nWIRE 0 16 0 -32\r\nWIRE 0 96 0 128\r\nFLAG 208 128 0\r\nFLAG 256 -32 out\r\nFLAG 0 128 0\r\nFLAG 0 -32 in\r\nSYMBOL voltage 0 0 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName V1\r\nSYMATTR Value AC 1\r\nSYMBOL cap 112 -48 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 0 32 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 32 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName C1\r\nSYMATTR Value 100n\r\nSYMBOL res 192 0 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName R1\r\nSYMATTR Value 1k\r\nTEXT 0 -224 Left 2 ;First-order high-pass (CR): H(s) = sRC / (1 + sRC) = s / (s + ωc)\\nfc = 1 / (2π RC) ≈ 1.59 kHz: one pole at s = −1/RC and a zero at s = 0.\\nStep: out jumps to 1 and decays as e^(−t/τ). Bode: +20 dB/decade below fc and flat above; the phase goes from +90° to 0.\r\nTEXT 0 192 Left 2 !.ac dec 100 10 100k\r\n",
  "sha256:ea732d5a2d763478de9dc083c454e303fa6cf5348009a25aaae89c0cd3dbee27": "Version 4\r\nSHEET 1 1200 800\r\nWIRE 0 -32 48 -32\r\nWIRE 112 -32 208 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 256 -32\r\nWIRE 208 -32 208 16\r\nWIRE 208 96 208 128\r\nWIRE 0 16 0 -32\r\nWIRE 0 96 0 128\r\nFLAG 208 128 0\r\nFLAG 256 -32 out\r\nFLAG 0 128 0\r\nFLAG 0 -32 in\r\nSYMBOL voltage 0 0 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName V1\r\nSYMATTR Value AC 1\r\nSYMBOL cap 112 -48 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 0 32 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 32 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName C1\r\nSYMATTR Value 100n\r\nSYMBOL res 192 0 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName R1\r\nSYMATTR Value 1k\r\nTEXT 0 -224 Left 2 ;First-order high-pass (CR): H(s) = sRC / (1 + sRC) = s / (s + ωc)\\nfc = 1 / (2π RC) ≈ 1.59 kHz: one pole at s = −1/RC and a zero at s = 0.\\nStep: out jumps to 1 and decays as e^(−t/τ). Bode: +20 dB/decade below fc and flat above; the phase goes from +90° to 0.\r\nTEXT 0 192 Left 2 ;.pz in 0 out 0 vol pz\r\n",
  "sha256:9c4ccfe1afb7a77aa8c2c4ac5fdfff0afa22fe267f220066441f865f584909a5": "Version 4\r\nSHEET 1 1200 800\r\nWIRE 0 16 0 -32\r\nWIRE 0 96 0 128\r\nWIRE 0 -32 80 -32\r\nWIRE 80 -32 112 -32\r\nWIRE 192 -32 224 -32\r\nWIRE 288 -32 224 -32\r\nWIRE 224 -32 224 -128\r\nWIRE 224 -128 304 -128\r\nWIRE 384 -128 464 -128\r\nWIRE 464 -128 464 0\r\nWIRE 400 0 464 0\r\nWIRE 464 0 512 0\r\nWIRE 80 -32 80 32\r\nWIRE 80 32 112 32\r\nWIRE 192 32 224 32\r\nWIRE 224 32 288 32\r\nWIRE 224 32 224 64\r\nWIRE 224 128 224 160\r\nFLAG 0 128 0\r\nFLAG 0 -32 in\r\nFLAG 512 0 out\r\nFLAG 224 160 0\r\nSYMBOL voltage 0 0 R0\r\nWINDOW 3 24 96 Invisible 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName V1\r\nSYMATTR Value PULSE(0 1 0 1n 1n 1 2)\r\nSYMBOL res 208 -48 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 0 56 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName R2\r\nSYMATTR Value 10k\r\nSYMBOL res 400 -144 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 0 56 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName R3\r\nSYMATTR Value 10k\r\nSYMBOL OA_NoPole 480 -48 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName U1\r\nSYMBOL res 208 16 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 0 56 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName R1\r\nSYMATTR Value 1k\r\nSYMBOL cap 208 64 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName C1\r\nSYMATTR Value 100n\r\nTEXT 0 -352 Left 2 ;First-order all-pass with an op amp: R1-C1 is a low-pass into the + input, and R2 = R3 make the amplifier subtract the input (U1 has no poles: only its gain):\\nout = 2·V(+) − in = in · (2 / (1 + sRC) − 1), that is, H(s) = V(out) / V(in) = (1 − sRC) / (1 + sRC).\\n|H| = 1 at every frequency and the phase goes from 0 to −180° (−90° at 1.59 kHz). The pole is at s = −1/RC and the zero at s = +1/RC,\\nits mirror image on the right half-plane. Step: out starts at −1 (C1 holds + at 0) and goes to +1.\r\nTEXT 0 224 Left 2 !.tran 1m\r\n",
  "sha256:6499df82004c1451130d1d65d0f8bbc43c7b3021d10d3e503f1ec7a58201231c": "Version 4\r\nSHEET 1 1200 800\r\nWIRE 0 16 0 -32\r\nWIRE 0 96 0 128\r\nWIRE 0 -32 80 -32\r\nWIRE 80 -32 112 -32\r\nWIRE 192 -32 224 -32\r\nWIRE 288 -32 224 -32\r\nWIRE 224 -32 224 -128\r\nWIRE 224 -128 304 -128\r\nWIRE 384 -128 464 -128\r\nWIRE 464 -128 464 0\r\nWIRE 400 0 464 0\r\nWIRE 464 0 512 0\r\nWIRE 80 -32 80 32\r\nWIRE 80 32 112 32\r\nWIRE 192 32 224 32\r\nWIRE 224 32 288 32\r\nWIRE 224 32 224 64\r\nWIRE 224 128 224 160\r\nFLAG 0 128 0\r\nFLAG 0 -32 in\r\nFLAG 512 0 out\r\nFLAG 224 160 0\r\nSYMBOL voltage 0 0 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName V1\r\nSYMATTR Value AC 1\r\nSYMBOL res 208 -48 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 0 56 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName R2\r\nSYMATTR Value 10k\r\nSYMBOL res 400 -144 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 0 56 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName R3\r\nSYMATTR Value 10k\r\nSYMBOL OA_NoPole 480 -48 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName U1\r\nSYMBOL res 208 16 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 0 56 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName R1\r\nSYMATTR Value 1k\r\nSYMBOL cap 208 64 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName C1\r\nSYMATTR Value 100n\r\nTEXT 0 -352 Left 2 ;First-order all-pass with an op amp: R1-C1 is a low-pass into the + input, and R2 = R3 make the amplifier subtract the input (U1 has no poles: only its gain):\\nout = 2·V(+) − in = in · (2 / (1 + sRC) − 1), that is, H(s) = V(out) / V(in) = (1 − sRC) / (1 + sRC).\\n|H| = 1 at every frequency and the phase goes from 0 to −180° (−90° at 1.59 kHz). The pole is at s = −1/RC and the zero at s = +1/RC,\\nits mirror image on the right half-plane. Step: out starts at −1 (C1 holds + at 0) and goes to +1.\r\nTEXT 0 224 Left 2 !.ac dec 100 10 100k\r\n",
